---
/* Reddit post by the example creator mika, composed in design/posts (see scripts/render-posts.py for its media).
   Drawn at 400x640 design pixels; Post.astro scales it to fit. Fictional, labeled as an example where it's shown. */
---

<div class="root" aria-hidden="true">
<div class="head">
    <span class="sr">r/</span>
    <span><b>r/SaaS <span>· 7h</span></b><small>mika_ships</small></span>
    <span class="sp"></span><span class="join">Join</span><span class="dots">···</span>
  </div>
  <h1>A flaky endpoint silently failed 4% of our signups for 3 weeks. Here's how I finally caught it.</h1>
  <span class="flair">Lessons learned</span>
  <div class="body">Short version: our signup API returned 200 with an empty body whenever one DB replica ran out of connections. Nothing in the logs, nothing in error tracking. We only noticed because MRR flatlined while traffic didn't. Three things I'd do differently: check response bodies, not just status codes...</div>
  <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="img" src="/assets/posts/mika.jpg" alt="">
  <div class="acts">
    <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 4 4 13h5v7h6v-7h5z"/></svg>1.2k<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round" style="opacity:.6"><path d="M12 20l8-9h-5V4H9v7H4z"/></svg></span>
    <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M21 12a8 8 0 0 1-11.6 7.1L4 20l1.1-4.6A8 8 0 1 1 21 12z"/></svg>214</span>
    <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M14 5l7 7-7 7M21 12H9a6 6 0 0 0-6 6"/></svg>Share</span>
  </div>
  <div class="cm">
    <span class="ava"></span>
    <div>
      <div class="who"><b>mika_ships</b> <span class="op">OP</span> · 6h</div>
      <p>Since a few people asked: it's Pingfield. They do 3 months at $9 through my link (I get a small cut, so skip it if you'd rather): <a>pingfield.comarket.si/creators/mika</a></p>
      <div class="ca"><span>⇧ 186 ⇩</span><span>Reply</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
.root {
  position: relative;
  width: 400px;
  height: 640px;
 font-family: -apple-system, 'SF Pro Text', system-ui, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; overflow: hidden; }
svg { display: block; }

/* iOS status bar, light or dark */
.sb { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; top: 0; height: 46px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 6px 26px 0 34px; font: 600 15px/1 -apple-system, system-ui; z-index: 50; }
.sb.dark { color: #fff; }
.sb.light { color: #000; }
.sb .r { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; }
.sb .bars { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 1.5px; height: 11px; }
.sb .bars i { width: 3px; border-radius: 1px; background: currentColor; }
.sb .bars i:nth-child(1) { height: 4px; } .sb .bars i:nth-child(2) { height: 6px; } .sb .bars i:nth-child(3) { height: 8.5px; } .sb .bars i:nth-child(4) { height: 11px; }
.sb .bars i.off { opacity: 0.35; }
.sb .batt { position: relative; width: 25px; height: 12px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid currentColor; opacity: 0.9; padding: 1.5px; }
.sb .batt::after { content: ''; position: absolute; right: -3.5px; top: 3.5px; width: 2px; height: 4px; border-radius: 0 1px 1px 0; background: currentColor; opacity: 0.5; }
.sb .batt b { display: block; height: 100%; border-radius: 2px; background: currentColor; }
.sb .batt.low b { background: #ffd60a; }


  /* A text post in r/SaaS in the mobile app, with OP's own comment underneath */
  .root { width: 400px; height: 640px; background: #fff; color: #1c1c1c; }
  .head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; padding: 12px 14px 0; }
  .sr { width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background: #2d7ff9; color: #fff; display: grid; place-items: center; font: 800 12px/1 -apple-system; }
  .head b { display: block; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; }
  .head b span { font-weight: 400; color: #6a6a6a; }
  .head small { display: block; font-size: 11.5px; color: #6a6a6a; margin-top: 1px; }
  .head .sp { flex: 1; }
  .join { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; background: #0a449b; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; }
  .dots { color: #6a6a6a; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 1px; }
  h1 { font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.28; font-weight: 700; padding: 9px 14px 0; letter-spacing: -0.005em; }
  .flair { display: inline-block; margin: 7px 14px 0; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #1c1c1c; background: #dbe7ff; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 999px; }
  ..root { position: relative; padding: 8px 14px 0; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.45; color: #2b2b2b; max-height: 82px; overflow: hidden; }
  .body::after { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; height: 30px; background: linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0), #fff); }
  .img { display: block; width: calc(100% - 28px); margin: 8px 14px 0; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid #eee; }
  .acts { display: flex; gap: 8px; padding: 10px 14px; }
  .acts span { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #2b2b2b; background: #eef1f3; padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 999px; }
  .acts svg { width: 15px; height: 15px; }
  .cm { margin: 2px 14px 0; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px solid #edeff1; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 24px 1fr; gap: 0 8px; }
  .ava { width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 50%; background: #ffd5a8; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .ava::before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 6px; top: 5px; width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; background: #fff; }
  .ava::after { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 3px; top: 16px; width: 18px; height: 14px; border-radius: 50%; background: #3a6ea5; }
  .cm .who { font-size: 12px; color: #6a6a6a; }
  .cm .who b { color: #1c1c1c; }
  .cm .op { color: #0a7cff; font-weight: 700; }
  .cm p { font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.42; color: #1c1c1c; margin-top: 3px; }
  .cm p a { color: #0a64d6; text-decoration: underline; }
  .cm .ca { display: flex; gap: 14px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #6a6a6a; margin-top: 6px; }
</style>
